    "detailed_description": "Bubble Sweeper is a fresh take on the classic game of MineSweeper. In addition to the traditional square playfield, Bubble Sweeper offers a variety of shapes and sizes to keep the game interesting. The clean graphics and satisfying sounds of popping bubbles make for an enjoyable experience. And if you accidentally hit a mine, the game is not over yet! You'll have a chance to finish the game before the timer runs out. Challenge yourself with the different playfield layouts, sizes, and difficulty levels! The perfect game for short play sessions!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose from different field layouts, shapes, and difficulty settings.<br></li><li>Enjoy updated, polished graphics and that satisfying sound of popping bubbles.<br></li><li>Second chance to finish the game before timer runs out</li></ul>",
